# Task
You are the reflector. Write:
- "summary": one or two sentences for the episodic log (what was done and what came of it)
- "task_update": if the focused task is now done, failed or should be in_progress, give {"task_id", "status", "note"}; else null
- "goal_update": if a goal is now achieved, blocked or should be abandoned, give {"goal_id", "status", "progress_note"}; else null
- "facts": durable facts learned (content, tags, confidence); usually zero to three
- "lessons": general, reusable lessons for the future (only if genuinely new); usually zero or one
- "dissent_vindicated": true if the recorded dissent turned out to be right, false if wrong, null if unclear or none
